WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.137
Ukraine's military is calling

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.071
Russia's bluff

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.340
near the strategic city of her son.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.375
Military spokeswoman

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.710
says Russia is creating an illusion

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.044
that it's

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:11.978
pulling out of the city

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:12.445
to lure

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.647
Ukrainian forces into street fighting.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:16.383
There have been indications of a possible

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:18.118
Russian withdrawal from her son,

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:19.919
but Moscow has also been sending

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.421
in reinforcements.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:22.756
Meanwhile, Russia is planning

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:24.791
to use more hardcore criminals

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.026
to fight in the war.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.961
President Putin has signed the law

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:28.661
to conscript

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:30.764
murderers, drug dealers and others

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:32.532
who were recently released from prison.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.900
The move could potentially allow

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:34.501
the deployment

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.403
of hundreds of thousands of people

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:37.737
who are previously banned

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.272
from the military.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:41.674
Now back in Ukraine, President Zelensky

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:42.308
says he's

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.943
not buying Iran's new claim

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.512
about supplying military drones

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:46.446
to Russia.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:46.946
Tehran

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:48.815
did an about face on Friday, saying

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.817
it sent a limited number of drones

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:52.852
to Moscow in the months before the war.

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:53.520
The statement came

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.154
after weeks

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:55.388
of Iranian denials

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.457
that it provided any drones to Russia.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.626
President Zelinsky says Iran's new claim

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.861
still doesn't add up to more.

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:04.330
Some Abdulaziz joins us from Kiev.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:05.665
So some Ukraine

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:06.666
pushing back hard on

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.501
those drone claims by Iran.

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:11.104
Yeah, a

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:11.971
very significant

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.173
admission came from

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:14.707
Iran's foreign minister

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.109
to a press conference saying

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:16.676
that, yes,

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.978
Iran did provide a limited number

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.613
of drones to Russia.

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.382
But and this is a very big bite.

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:24.751
It was prior to the conflict, months

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:25.985
prior to this conflict,

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.720
and that Iran has no knowledge

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.689
that Russia is using those drones

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.791
here in the war on Ukraine.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.093
Let me start by clarifying this

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:33.993
right away, Kim.

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.795
We do know that Iranian made drones

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.931
are being used here in Ukraine

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.265
because Ukrainian officials have found

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:39.999
the remnants of them

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.034
after they've struck out

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:41.868
apartment buildings

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:42.969
or terrorize citizens

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:44.037
and they've been able to show

00:01:44.037 --> 00:01:46.139
those remnants to journalists as well.

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.241
Now, what was also curious

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.142
about that statement

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:50.443
from Iran's foreign minister was

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.679
then he went on to ask Ukraine

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.481
to provide concrete evidence.

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:54.948
Take a listen

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:56.516
to how President Zelensky responded to

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:56.916
all this

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.719
to Rachel Wood today.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.621
There were messages from Iran,

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:04.324
from official representatives there.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:05.959
They decided to admit

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.660
that they did supply drones

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:08.862
for Russian terror.

00:02:08.862 --> 00:02:11.064
But even in this confession, they lied.

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:12.565
We shoot down at least

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:14.767
ten Iranian drones every day.

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:17.203
And if Iran continues

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:18.505
lying about the obvious,

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:19.706
it means that the world

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:21.174
will make even more efforts

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:21.975
to investigate

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:23.643
the terrorist cooperation

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.945
between the Russian and Iranian regimes

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.281
and what Russia is paying Iran

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:30.183
for such cooperation.

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.117
Is it the

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:35.455
now, not only has Iran provided

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:36.856
Russia with weapons.

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:38.124
Western sources say

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:39.392
that Tehran is preparing

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:39.792
to send

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.261
even more weapons

00:02:41.261 --> 00:02:43.096
to Russia, including more drones

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:44.697
and ballistic missiles.

00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:45.899
That's, of course, very crucial

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:46.366
to Russia.

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:47.934
That's used a great deal of its

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.936
arsenal here in the invasion of Ukraine.

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.971
It could help boost the fight for her

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:52.472
so and so.

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:54.440
A very curious statement there from Iran.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.375
And a final point.

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:56.876
This could also have consequences

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:57.710
for Iran itself.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.312
Kim, the United States, other

00:02:59.312 --> 00:02:59.913
allies have said

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:01.381
they will step up sanctions

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:02.749
if Iran continues to support

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:03.616
Moscow in this fight.

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:06.286
And Salma.

00:03:06.286 --> 00:03:06.920
Another story

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:07.453
we're following,

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:08.821
a Russia appointed judge

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:10.657
in the self-proclaimed Donetsk People's

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:11.491
Republic is

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:12.959
in serious condition

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:15.128
after an alleged assassination attempt.

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:17.997
What more can you tell us about that?

00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:20.366
Yes, very interesting report

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.635
that came out in the evening hours

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:23.403
yesterday.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:25.171
Russian appointed officials saying

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:26.873
that a Russian backed judge

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:27.974
in the Donetsk region

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:31.077
this is a Russian occupied region is now

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:32.345
in critical condition

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:33.813
after there was an assassination

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:34.681
attempt on him.

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:36.115
Now, this judge is significant.

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:36.482
His

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:37.550
he was the judge

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.786
who sentenced three foreigners

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.921
in June to death, including two

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:43.289
British fighters

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:43.923
who had been here

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:46.292
fighting with Ukrainian forces.

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:48.695
Now, Russian backed officials,

00:03:48.695 --> 00:03:50.496
Moscow blaming Ukraine for this.

00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:51.798
Ukraine not responding.

00:03:51.798 --> 00:03:52.966
But this isn't the first time

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:54.167
we've seen this where Russian backed

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:55.668
officials have been attacked

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:57.804
in these very shadowy circumstances.

00:03:57.937 --> 00:03:59.872
And you always get that sense, Kim,

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:00.206
that, yes,

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:02.408
we have this open war on the battlefield,

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:03.843
but there's also this other kind

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:04.877
of covert war

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:06.980
that happens in the shadows, Kim.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:07.380
All right.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.014
Thanks so much.

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:10.183
Salma Abdulaziz live in Kiev.

